// Parity with the 20 Hz design model: the shared weapon formulas against the numbers testing/realtime.py prints, the five loop
// weapons and fists. The tables are the same ones packages/shared/test/weapons.test.ts pins, generated by
// `python3 testing/weapon_reference.py`; paste them here too when the design numbers change.
